{"id":"n26736-2-7","stage":5,"title":"거듭나다 · 新生","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26736-2-7-1","ko":"저 아주머니 예전에는 정말 못됐었는데.","zh":"那个阿姨以前可真坏呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"아주머니","meaning":"大嫂，大妈，阿姨","explanation":"아주머니：大嫂，大妈，阿姨。","readings":[{"term":"아주머니","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89820","senseId":"2","lemma":"아주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주머니","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3"}},{"text":"예전에는","meaning":"很久以前","explanation":"예전：很久以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70090","senseId":"1","lemma":"예전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예전에는","audio":"/audio/dd88426ee57094c69780.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"못됐었는데.","meaning":"恶劣，坏","explanation":"못되다：恶劣，坏；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"못되다","audio":"/audio/02eca6473bc751db2413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15308","senseId":"1","lemma":"못되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못됐었는데","audio":"/audio/c9b6a1f9327f6c6c485a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"32bc34ce0694e2e2","term":"아주머니","zh":"大嫂，大妈，阿姨","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3","entryId":"89820","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼已婚女子。","pronunciation":["아주머니"]},{"id":"75497dc0562cdf68","term":"예전","zh":"很久以前","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3","entryId":"70090","definition":"过去很久的往日。","pronunciation":["예ː전"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"02eca6473bc751db","term":"못되다","zh":"恶劣，坏","audio":"/audio/02eca6473bc751db2413.mp3","entryId":"15308","definition":"从道德的角度上认为品行不佳。","pronunciation":["몯ː뙤다","몯ː뛔다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d949c486d8fa3681198.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26736-2-7-2","ko":"맞아. 요즘에는 완전 새사람으로 거듭났는지 정말 친절하시더라고.","zh":"对啊，最近好像完全变了个人似的，特别友善呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘에는","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘에는","audio":"/audio/89b296d651a66ff651ca.mp3"}},{"text":"완전","meaning":"完全，完整，完美","explanation":"완전：完全，完整，完美。","readings":[{"term":"완전","audio":"/audio/336ecb2bea04bdfe5ace.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22152","senseId":"1","lemma":"완전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"완전","audio":"/audio/336ecb2bea04bdfe5ace.mp3"}},{"text":"새사람으로","meaning":"新的；人","explanation":"새：新的；사람：人；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"},{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17884","senseId":"1","lemma":"새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새사람으로","audio":"/audio/fe5aea06d9391bfe5138.mp3"}},{"text":"거듭났는지","meaning":"新生，重生","explanation":"거듭나다：新生，重生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"거듭나다","audio":"/audio/5fa2181129fb2ec7e6b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26736","senseId":"2","lemma":"거듭나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거듭났는지","audio":"/audio/1a64161a43e7d9cdf8bc.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"친절하시더라고.","meaning":"亲切，关切，热情","explanation":"친절하다：亲切，关切，热情；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"친절하다","audio":"/audio/ffcfc4ac1458aeaf5919.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72157","senseId":"1","lemma":"친절하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친절하시더라고","audio":"/audio/c45182d900c3ebf3f27b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"336ecb2bea04bdfe","term":"완전","zh":"完全，完整，完美","audio":"/audio/336ecb2bea04bdfe5ace.mp3","entryId":"22152","definition":"没有不足之处，全部东西都具备。","pronunciation":["완전"]},{"id":"e2d38c50201cf36d","term":"새","zh":"新的","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3","entryId":"17884","definition":"不是已有的，而是第一次出现的。","pronunciation":["새"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5fa2181129fb2ec7","term":"거듭나다","zh":"新生，重生","audio":"/audio/5fa2181129fb2ec7e6b8.mp3","entryId":"26736","definition":"抛弃之前的方式或态度，重新开始。","pronunciation":["거듬나다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"ffcfc4ac1458aeaf","term":"친절하다","zh":"亲切，关切，热情","audio":"/audio/ffcfc4ac1458aeaf5919.mp3","entryId":"72157","definition":"待人的态度和蔼可亲。","pronunciation":["친절하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8455fb3a63272b2e2640.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.318,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26736","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":158,"sequenceScore":3.1447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对啊，最近好像完全变了个人似的，特别友善呢。","那个阿姨以前可真坏呢。","患者，您还有其他疾病吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个阿姨以前可真坏呢。","患者，您还有其他疾病吗？","对啊，最近好像完全变了个人似的，特别友善呢。"],"answer":2}]}
